<board>
<plain>
<circle x="0" y="0" radius="30" width="0.125" layer="20"/>
<text x="12.8" y="-4.8" size="0.5" layer="22" font="vector" rot="MR0">And no one hears a word they say
Has the memory gone? Are you feeling numb?
Not a word they say
But a voiceless crowd isn't backing down
When the air turns red
With their loaded hesitation
Can you say my name?
Has the memory gone? Are you feeling numb?
Have we all become invisible?</text>
<text x="-3.4" y="-16.9" size="0.5" layer="22" rot="MR0">i spent like more than 24 hours on this you better fly</text>
</plain>
